    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Disclaimer</h1>
    
    <div class="mt-8 prose prose-lg max-w-none text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 15, 2026</p>

      <h2>General Information</h2>
      <p>
        The content on AI Career Guide is for educational and informational purposes only. It is not professional advice. While we strive for accuracy, we make no guarantees.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>
        Some posts contain affiliate links. If you click on these links and make a purchase, we may receive a commission at no extra cost to you. We only recommend products we have researched or believe provide value.
      </p>

      <h2>External Links</h2>
      <p>
        We may link to external websites. We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of those sites.
      </p>

      <h2>No Guarantee of Results</h2>
      <p>
        Any guidance, strategies, or suggestions we provide are based on our experience and research. Your results may vary, and we cannot guarantee career advancement or job placement.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any questions about this disclaimer, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
